:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    round: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scope: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'polish'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    changeLimit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    focusAreas: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'parameter_tuning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'edge_cases'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flow_optimization'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exitCriteria: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completion_rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'satisfaction_score'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每轮迭代都应有明确的退出标准（Exit Criteria）。没有退出标准的迭代会陷入&quot;无限打磨&quot;陷阱——关卡永远不够完美，但项目有截止日期。设计者需要学会在&quot;足够好&quot;和&quot;完美&quot;之间做出务实的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((关卡原型与迭代))&#10;    保真度递进&#10;      纸面原型&#10;      灰盒原型&#10;      白盒原型&#10;      美术通道&#10;    灰盒验证&#10;      度量测试&#10;      视线检查&#10;      节奏验证&#10;    游戏测试&#10;      开发者测试&#10;      焦点测试&#10;      大规模测试&#10;    迭代收敛&#10;      探索性迭代&#10;      调整性迭代&#10;      抛光性迭代&#10;      退出标准\">mindmap\n  root((关卡原型与迭代))\n    保真度递进\n      纸面原型\n      灰盒原型\n      白盒原型\n      美术通道\n    灰盒验证\n      度量测试\n      视线检查\n      节奏验证\n    游戏测试\n      开发者测试\n      焦点测试\n      大规模测试\n    迭代收敛\n      探索性迭代\n      调整性迭代\n      抛光性迭代\n      退出标准</pre><ul>\n<li>关卡原型遵循&quot;保真度递进&quot;原则，从纸面到灰盒到白盒逐步提升</li>\n<li>灰盒是最重要的原型阶段，此阶段发现的问题修复成本最低</li>\n<li>度量验证应系统化执行，确保每个空间元素与角色运动参数匹配</li>\n<li>焦点测试使用出声思维协议，不打断测试者、不问主观问题</li>\n<li>迭代收敛遵循&quot;三轮法则&quot;：探索性→调整性→抛光性，逐步缩小改动范围</li>\n<li>每轮迭代必须设定明确的退出标准，避免&quot;无限打磨&quot;陷阱</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关卡原型与迭代","id":"关卡原型与迭代"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"纸面原型与空间规划","id":"纸面原型与空间规划"},{"level":2,"text":"灰盒构建与度量验证","id":"灰盒构建与度量验证"},{"level":2,"text":"游戏测试与反馈收集","id":"游戏测试与反馈收集"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代策略与收敛原则","id":"迭代策略与收敛原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"难度曲线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/difficulty-curve"},"next":{"title":"虚拟经济体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/virtual-economy"}}